Thank you all for your help.  I just ascended Eric the Caveman with,
all things considered, not too much trouble.  I did burn one amulet of
lifesaving on the astral plane while fighting famine- not sure how he
hurt me so badly due to a swarm of air elementals.  The 400 hp (500 at
its highest point, 420 after a brush with DEATH) proved to be more
than enough- except for on the plane of air where the air elementals
tore me apart.  A few potions of full healing saved my life there.
Rodney caused me a lot of trouble- I killed him 15 times including
twice on the plane of earth and again on water.  2 scrolls of charging
plus a handful of wands of death and teleport made the whole process
pretty straight forward.  However, had I not been lawful an Archon
standing right in front of Anu's altar would have been very
problematic.  In addition to Rodney,I also killed 9 arch-liches 15
master liches and 15 master mindflayers.  Pretty big numbers for my
games.  It was a very enlightening experience ascending with crap
armor.  Thank you all for your input.

